1
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:34,600
He should be here by now.

2
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,000
Reporting.

3
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,640
Wu Dazhou.

4
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:40,720
I didn't expect

5
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,440
the Army to deploy such an elite unit

6
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,520
to reinforce the Blue Force.

7
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:45,800
Yuanshan,

8
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,520
his mission

9
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,560
is to take out the Red Force's

10
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,720
two new-type battalions.

11
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,640
Reporting, sir.

12
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,160
I've fought against Hurricane Battalion

13
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,520
and Wind Rider Battalion's commanders

14
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,200
before.

15
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,320
I know them very well.

16
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,000
You can issue your orders directly, sir.

17
00:01:59,000 --> 00:01:59,760
Don't brag.

18
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,840
I've already set the trap for you.

19
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:02,720
Now,

20
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,160
it's time for your show.

21
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,040
Understood.

22
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,680
Whatever it takes, you must find out

23
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,000
if this unit

24
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,720
is actually the Wind Rider Battalion.

25
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:13,680
Yes, sir.

26
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,040
Excellent.

27
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:36,800
Brigade Commander,

28
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,640
Hurricane Battalion's recon detachment

29
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:39,680
just obtained some intel.

30
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,680
The Blue Force command post

31
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,760
is stationed in a factory in Dingge Zhen.

32
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,960
Is the intel accurate?

33
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,800
Absolutely accurate.

34
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:48,320
Liu Wangyuan sent it from near the site.

35
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,240
Our scouts

36
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:51,720
managed to snap a photo of

37
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:52,960
the enemy commanders.

38
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,400
Although it's a bit blurry,

39
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,080
we can be absolutely certain

40
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,080
it's Di Yunfeng and Long Yuanshan.

41
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,080
This Liu Wangyuan...

42
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,160
Not bad at all.

43
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,480
Give the recon detachment a commendation.

44
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:02,880
Yes, sir.

45
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,560
Has Jiang Shengqiang made a move?

46
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,680
I'm guessing right as we speak,

47
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:07,560
the long-range artillery

48
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,640
has already covered the target.

49
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,800
I didn't expect

50
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,880
the Blue Force command post

51
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:14,880
to actually be in Dingge Zhen.

52
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:18,520
They dared to use their real command post

53
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,480
as bait.

54
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:20,920
This Di Yunfeng

55
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,520
is being a bit too overconfident.

56
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,640
Di Yunfeng is unpredictable.

57
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,040
Because of what happened to the 5th Battalion,

58
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:26,960
even I felt

59
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:27,760
that it was a

60
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,080
trap to lure our forces in.

61
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,240
This whole situation...

62
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,880
probably isn't that simple.

63
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,520
This Di Yunfeng

64
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,880
sure is crafty.

65
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:51,800
This battle has turned into a spy drama.

66
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:54,440
In war,

67
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,600
make the real seem false,

68
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,240
and the false seem real.

69
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,920
This Blue Force commander

70
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:04,200
really lives up to his reputation.

71
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:09,160
Battalion Commander.

72
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,600
Long-range fire suppression,

73
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,720
precision missile guidance,

74
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,160
and coordinated drone strikes.

75
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,280
Decapitation Operation

76
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:14,840
is a complete success.

77
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:16,480
Confirm the strike results.

78
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,360
Judging from the drone footage,

79
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,240
the strike was effective.

80
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,480
Good.

81
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,920
Notify Staff Officer Liu.

82
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,360
Give him a company,

83
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,080
along with attached detachments,

84
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,480
to mop up the remaining Blue Force there.

85
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:28,400
Yes, sir.

86
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:30,720
Something's wrong.

87
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,400
It's an ambush!

88
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,280
Fall back!

89
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,440
Wu Dazhou.

90
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,440
The message has been sent.

91
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,560
Just wait for Guo Zijian to deal with you.

92
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,320
Report.

93
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:31,760
Speak.

94
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,000
Staff Officer Liu sent back a message.

95
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,560
The target in Dingge Zhen is a decoy.

96
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,240
They were ambushed

97
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,640
by Wu Dazhou's special ops team.

98
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,520
Liu did a great job.

99
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,240
It was my misjudgment.

100
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,800
This Di Yunfeng is simply too cunning.

101
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,080
After all that,

102
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,880
the command post turned out to be a trap.

103
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:50,680
Strike ineffective.

104
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,640
How is that possible?

105
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:53,160
Exercise Control doesn't make mistakes.

106
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,480
They exploited a time gap.

107
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,320
There's only one explanation.

108
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:03,160
He and Long Yuanshan showed themselves

109
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,880
just to put on a show for us.

110
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,720
They waited for our scouts to confirm

111
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,880
before casually leaving,

112
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,600
leaving Wu Dazhou behind

113
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:13,360
to slaughter the baited prey.

114
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,520
In other words,

115
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,280
our scouts

116
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:18,320
were under their control from the very beginning.

117
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:19,800
From the very beginning,

118
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,840
we were being monitored by them.

119
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,720
We still fell for their trap.

120
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,400
But Liu's appearance

121
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,560
can at least provide them with some Reassurance.

122
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,800
Making them believe

123
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:34,200
that we are the Wind Rider Battalion.

124
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:36,000
If that's the case,

125
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,560
then the main operational plan

126
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,720
can continue to advance.

127
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,720
But we've lost quite a few troops now.

128
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:42,680
Furthermore,

129
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,840
they've completely locked down this area.

130
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,120
We must break out.

131
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,000
Don't panic.

132
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,800
Wait until after midnight,

133
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,440
move toward the sea and camouflage.

134
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,920
Await the Brigade Commander's orders.

135
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:54,320
Yes, sir.

136
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,480
This way,

137
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,520
Jiang Shengqiang's firepower deployment

138
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,400
and actual strength

139
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:02,640
have basically been exposed.

140
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,000
So what do we do now?

141
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,560
Given the Blue Force's massive firepower,

142
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,320
this time,

143
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:07,560
it's bound to be a

144
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,720
joint annihilation operation against us.

145
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,160
Pass on my orders.

146
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:13,800
Order the artillery battalion,

147
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,560
after nightfall,

148
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,280
to immediately set up artillery positions

149
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,240
two kilometers east of our current location,

150
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:18,960
in an irregular, dispersed formation.

151
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,600
Order the engineer battalion,

152
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,520
after nightfall,

153
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,520
to immediately begin setting up obstacles

154
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,120
and be prepared

155
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,160
to breach obstacles at any time.

156
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,280
Order the reconnaissance battalion

157
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,120
to conduct a full-scale search

158
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,080
for the Blue Force's main body.

159
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,640
They can break formation if necessary.

160
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:31,320
Also,

161
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,600
for the combat detachments

162
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,120
that have regrouped and assembled,

163
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:35,240
upon receiving the order,

164
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,840
head to the Phoenix Cry Mountain area.

165
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:37,280
Yes, sir.

166
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,320
Old Xu,

167
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:41,360
I suggest

168
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,120
deploying Wind Rider Battalion at once,

169
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:44,880
with Sky Eye providing strike support.

170
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:45,520
It's time.

171
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:46,800
Yes.

172
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,320
It's time.

173
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,600
In this round,

174
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:15,160
you could say the Red Force used Sky Eye

175
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,200
to catch the Blue Force off guard.

176
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:18,200
However,

177
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,720
their own losses are still severe.

178
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:24,480
Currently, the Blue Force's combatants

179
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,400
basically maintain

180
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,520
a reinforced regiment's

181
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,680
operational strength.

182
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:30,680
Furthermore,

183
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,600
their special ops unit

184
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:33,760
is still fully intact.

185
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,000
The Red Force

186
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,880
is in deep trouble.

187
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:40,440
Although our numbers fall short of the Blue Force,

188
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,480
my Wind Rider Battalion

189
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,880
hasn't even taken the field yet.

190
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:47,040
And they are equipped with new gear.

191
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,680
They are

192
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,960
worth ten men each.

193
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:52,840
Report!

194
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:55,000
Wu Dazhou pulled it off.

195
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:00,480
Yuanshan,

196
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:01,880
take a look at this.

197
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,680
Should our exercise this time

198
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,640
be brought to an early end?

199
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,240
But their effective forces

200
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,600
haven't been wiped out yet.

201
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:21,200
Wind Rider Battalion's operations officer

202
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,600
has already been

203
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,520
gloriously eliminated by Wu Dazhou.

204
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,680
Wind Rider Battalion's remaining troops

205
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:30,360
have been pushed to the coast by our special ops.

206
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,440
If they make even the slightest move,

207
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:35,080
I can wipe them out completely.

208
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,600
What else is there for you to worry about?

209
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:41,960
I suggest

210
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,440
using satellites and drones

211
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,200
over hundreds of square kilometers here

212
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,640
to conduct a comprehensive search.

213
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,000
Are you saying

214
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,720
he'll have a surprise force

215
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,040
descend from the sky?

216
00:10:58,880 --> 00:10:59,920
Without seeing with my own eyes

217
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:01,240
that brat Guo Zijian show up,

218
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,000
I won't jump to any conclusions.

219
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,680
Guo Zijian again.

220
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,680
Comrades,

221
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,320
from this moment on,

222
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,920
we are reactivated.

223
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,760
Due to the special circumstances,

224
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,520
subsequent orders

225
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:17,480
will be transmitted via Secure Channel GP-Y.

226
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,200
The current situation is that

227
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:22,280
Blue Force retains a reinforced regiment,

228
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,760
fully equipped and well-deployed.

229
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:26,560
After suffering heavy blows,

230
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,600
besides us, the 396th Brigade

231
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,200
only has its headquarters left,

232
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,280
along with some fragmented units.

233
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,280
In short,

234
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,200
the situation is grim.

235
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,040
The 396th Brigade is counting on us.

236
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:39,080
Some comrades might ask,

237
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,240
where is Hurricane Battalion?

238
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:42,920
Let me tell you.

239
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,520
Currently, Hurricane Battalion

240
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,200
is down to half a battalion's strength,

241
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,560
and they are all trapped.

242
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,800
Battalion Commander Jiang and his Hurricane Battalion,

243
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,440
from the moment they left the base,

244
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,960
have posed as our Wind Rider Battalion.

245
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,480
Even after taking hits,

246
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,600
their communications

247
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:59,800
used Wind Rider Battalion's call signs.

248
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,800
Why do you think that is?

249
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:03,160
It is to cover Wind Rider Battalion

250
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:05,280
to deal a fatal blow to the Blue Force.

251
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,200
Exactly.

252
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,000
For the sake of a greater victory,

253
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:11,280
Battalion Commander Jiang and Hurricane Battalion

254
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:13,080
willingly sacrificed their own honor

255
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:15,720
to clear minefields and take bullets for us.

256
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:18,120
This kind of brotherhood and selflessness

257
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,320
makes me, Guo Zijian, truly humbled.

258
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,240
If we fail to win this battle,

259
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,240
we'd let down Battalion Commander Jiang

260
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:28,840
and Hurricane Battalion's sacrifices.

261
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:31,080
Comrades,

262
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,920
as a people's army,

263
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:36,000
if we cannot win battles,

264
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:38,960
it means the fall of our homeland

265
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:40,280
and the suffering of our people.

266
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,400
It would also be a disgrace

267
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:44,920
that our troops can never wash away.

268
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,520
Now, I order:

269
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,640
Air Assault Unit,

270
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,640
split into two forces to night-raid the Blue Force airport

271
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:56,760
and artillery positions.

272
00:12:56,760 --> 00:12:57,480
Yes, sir!

273
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,560
Long-Range Artillery Unit,

274
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:01,480
target the Blue Force Special Ops platoon

275
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,760
at the Dingge Zhen fertilizer plant,

276
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,880
with intermittent artillery fire.

277
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:05,560
Yes, sir!

278
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:06,240
Drone Formation,

279
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:09,120
target Blue Force armor at Huangmei Ridge,

280
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:11,920
and precision-strike Wasp Slope artillery.

281
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:12,680
Yes, sir!

282
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:14,560
All combat teams, split into three routes.

283
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,800
Accompanied by recon and early-warning forces,

284
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:18,400
with full drone surveillance.

285
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:20,760
One route goes to the fertilizer plant in Dingge Zhen

286
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,520
to eliminate Wu Dazhou's remnants.

287
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:23,880
One route heads to Huangmei Ridge.

288
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,600
The last route heads to

289
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:27,080
suspected command post at Sea Breeze Pass.

290
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:30,360
Engage the enemy according to the combat plan.

291
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:31,480
Special Ops Platoon!

292
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:32,480
Here!

293
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,960
Based on earlier recon,

294
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:36,760
the only ambush spot for Cheetah Commando

295
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,760
is Eagle Beak Canyon.

296
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:40,000
First Combat Team of the Special Ops Platoon,

297
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,000
take a helicopter

298
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,320
and arrive there in advance.

299
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:45,120
Second and Third Teams, spread out to escort the infantry.

300
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:45,880
Yes, sir!

301
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:48,600
Staff Officer Liang leads the Electronic Warfare Detachment.

302
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:49,200
Yes, sir!

303
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:50,720
Comrades,

304
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,720
during the early preparations,

305
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:54,560
we entered a closed hibernation,

306
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:57,040
keeping even the Exercise Control personnel in the dark.

307
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,720
Now, the control personnel for all units are in position.

308
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,680
Everything is ready.

309
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,080
I order,

310
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,560
all personnel of Wind Rider Battalion,

311
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,720
move out!

312
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:08,480
Yes, sir!

313
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:50,440
Old Qiao,

314
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,640
see that?

315
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,280
With the battle at this stage,

316
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:57,600
the curtain on the future battlefield has lifted.

317
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:58,840
Soon,

318
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:02,440
Guo Zijian's joint operations chess game

319
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:04,400
will be laid out before Di Yunfeng.

320
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:07,200
This is a typical prototype of all-domain operations.

321
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,440
Information warfare will be more absolute.

322
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:10,880
It's just a single battalion.

323
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,840
The disparity in strength is too great.

324
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:15,400
Guo Zijian...

325
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:18,080
Guo Zijian might not be able to turn the tables.

326
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:22,680
As modern technology permeates everything,

327
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:24,240
the scale of future battlefields

328
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:26,480
is no longer classified

329
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,800
by personnel and equipment quantities.

330
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,680
Those were your words.

331
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:34,000
You're using my own words against me.

332
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,160
Zhang,

333
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:38,560
I remember back then,

334
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:40,800
you weren't very optimistic about the Wind Rider Battalion.

335
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:43,120
Oh, you.

336
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:45,080
Judging from the current

337
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:46,920
few small-scale localized battles around the world,

338
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,440
expanding battalion-level capabilities

339
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:52,200
has already become a trend.

340
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:53,960
This is not only seen

341
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,520
in countries that aren't military powers,

342
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,440
but even

343
00:15:57,960 --> 00:16:00,000
major powers with superior militaries

344
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,600
are actively implementing it.

345
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:02,960
This time,

346
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:06,640
I fully trust Wind Rider Battalion and Guo Zijian.

347
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:37,440
All set and ready.

348
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:39,120
We will accomplish the mission.

349
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:41,640
On my command.

350
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,360
Stand by to move out.

351
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:44,440
Lin Yihu!

352
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,040
Here!

353
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:46,240
First Squad, prepare to assemble.

354
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,200
Yes, sir!

355
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:05,680
Battalion Commander.

356
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,200
Didn't get any sleep?

357
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:08,320
Can't sleep.

358
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:13,280
Before we cut all outside contact,

359
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:15,320
we sent out two messages.

360
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,680
One was to the brigade command post,

361
00:17:18,320 --> 00:17:20,560
and the other to the Wind Rider Battalion.

362
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,040
Now it seems

363
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,440
neither of them

364
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,040
worked.

365
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,160
Tell me your thoughts.

366
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:30,800
The search perimeter is closing in on the alert zone.

367
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:32,400
It seems

368
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,480
at daybreak,

369
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:35,320
the charade

370
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,920
will be exposed.

371
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:38,520
Be patient.

372
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:40,920
Sometimes,

373
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,760
waiting quietly

374
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,560
also reflects a unit's discipline.

375
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,000
Captain.

376
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:12,840
It's so late.

377
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:15,160
Why'd Brigade Commander order a sweep?

378
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,200
Delays are dangerous.

379
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:20,440
Right now, our troop strength and firepower

380
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:22,280
far exceed theirs.

381
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:24,320
As long as we catch their men,

382
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:26,120
they will undoubtedly lose.

383
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,320
Do you think the Brigade Commander

384
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,200
is also having doubts?

385
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:31,560
Doubts about what?

386
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,480
The Brigade Commander's assurance

387
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,480
and confidence in us

388
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,360
all stem from

389
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:38,080
our ability to execute commands precisely.

390
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:41,200
He just doesn't want to drag this out.

391
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:42,280
Right.

392
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:43,200
Concentrate our firepower

393
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:44,240
and end the battle at once.

394
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:09,080
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

395
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:12,200
The enemy search team has entered the forward positions.

396
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:13,520
Requesting orders.

397
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:16,080
Can you wipe out the enemy without opening fire?

398
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:20,640
They must be special forces.

399
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:21,560
They won't be easy to deal with.

400
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,440
Once your position is exposed,

401
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:24,960
eliminate the enemy on the spot.

402
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,800
All personnel, abandon your current positions

403
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:28,360
and relocate to new hiding spots immediately.

404
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:29,320
Yes, sir.

405
00:19:55,120 --> 00:19:56,520
Rewind the video a bit.

406
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:58,840
Play it from here.

407
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:02,920
Fall in!

408
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:04,760
Emergency assembly!

409
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:28,520
Don't get cocky.

410
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:30,280
Even though we've been taken out,

411
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,560
you've exposed yourselves too.

412
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:32,960
None of you will get away.

413
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:34,520
Is that so?

414
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:45,680
The rest of the Red Army's main force has been located.

415
00:20:45,840 --> 00:20:47,120
But once they open fire,

416
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:48,560
他们'll relocate immediately.

417
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:50,960
Our follow-up forces have caught up.

418
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:51,880
They won't get away.

419
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:54,640
Now it's all up to us.

420
00:20:58,040 --> 00:20:59,120
Where did those planes come from?

421
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:01,320
Did our fighters get the intel too

422
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:02,520
and go in for a bombing run?

423
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:03,560
Impossible.

424
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:04,600
The intel is point-to-point.

425
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:05,880
I haven't even reported it yet.

426
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:09,120
It's the Red Army!

427
00:21:09,360 --> 00:21:09,840
Take cover!

428
00:21:09,840 --> 00:21:10,320
Take cover!

429
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:27,360
Report!

430
00:21:27,560 --> 00:21:28,360
Combat report received.

431
00:21:28,360 --> 00:21:29,640
The Blue Force Special Ops camp

432
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:31,720
is under full fire from Wind Rider Battalion.

433
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:32,760
Infantry units

434
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:34,280
are expected to arrive at the camp soon

435
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:35,080
to clear the battlefield.

436
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:36,760
We're liberated.

437
00:21:36,840 --> 00:21:37,480
Good.

438
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:40,120
Guo Zijian didn't let me down.

439
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:41,640
Orders.

440
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:42,760
Launch a full assault

441
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:45,120
and wipe out all Blue Force search teams.

442
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,720
Send a message to Wind Rider Battalion.

443
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,400
Tell them to watch out for

444
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:50,880
the Blue Force's Cheetah Commando.

445
00:21:51,280 --> 00:21:52,360
A lot of our equipment

446
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:54,640
was destroyed by those brats.

447
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,160
Yes, sir.

448
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:00,520
Guo Zijian,

449
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:03,520
it's time to show your true skills.

450
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:16,720
Report.

451
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,640
Our Special Ops camp in Dingge Zhen

452
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:20,720
is under multi-wave Red Force air strikes.

453
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:22,160
Personnel narrowly survived,

454
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:23,600
but equipment suffered heavy losses.

455
00:22:24,280 --> 00:22:25,760
Where is this firepower coming from?

456
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:29,680
Could it be Xu Lingjun's second echelon?

457
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:30,920
No need to guess.

458
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,880
It must be Guo Zijian's Wind Rider Battalion.

459
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:36,720
Sir.

460
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,400
The armored positions at Huangmei Ridge

461
00:22:38,520 --> 00:22:39,400
and the artillery in Wild Bee Valley

462
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:41,200
are under saturation drone strikes.

463
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,320
Their combat loss rates have reached

464
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:43,640
60% and 65%, respectively.

465
00:22:46,840 --> 00:22:47,680
Pass on my orders.

466
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,680
All long-range equipment in our unit

467
00:22:51,760 --> 00:22:53,640
must go on full combat alert.

468
00:22:53,640 --> 00:22:54,440
Yes, sir.

469
00:23:04,800 --> 00:23:05,360
Order

470
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:08,560
the reconnaissance and early warning detachment

471
00:23:09,280 --> 00:23:11,360
to locate the source of Red Army's fire.

472
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:11,720
Yes, sir.

473
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:13,240
Report.

474
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:13,920
Go ahead.

475
00:23:14,040 --> 00:23:14,960
Reconnaissance shows

476
00:23:15,120 --> 00:23:16,840
that three Red Army infantry units

477
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:20,240
are advancing via Haicheng County and Dingmei County.

478
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:22,040
They are 60 kilometers away.

479
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:24,440
Due to darkness, their equipment is unknown.

480
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:29,560
After attacking from the sky,

481
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:31,960
they sweep the ground.

482
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:36,200
Looks like they're trying to wipe us out.

483
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:42,760
He's dreaming.

484
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:48,920
It's time for my Cheetah Commando

485
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:50,360
to show what they're made of.

486
00:23:50,800 --> 00:23:51,560
Pass on my order.

487
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:54,280
Our infantry units

488
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:56,160
must at all costs

489
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,920
delay the Red Army convoy's advance.

490
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,040
Furthermore,

491
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:01,440
order Tian Kang

492
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:03,360
to set up an ambush at Eagle Beak Canyon.

493
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:05,560
An ambush at Eagle Beak Canyon.

494
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:06,840
Tell him

495
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:10,120
to wipe out the Red Army special ops unit.

496
00:24:10,440 --> 00:24:12,280
Don't let a single soldier escape.

497
00:24:13,040 --> 00:24:13,760
Otherwise,

498
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:16,240
tell him never to see me again.

499
00:24:16,320 --> 00:24:16,960
Yes, sir!

500
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:22,840
Eagle Beak Canyon is indeed a good place for an ambush.

501
00:24:23,600 --> 00:24:25,240
I just wonder if we can actually

502
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,200
get a bite of this juicy meat.

503
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:34,600
I, Di Yunfeng,

504
00:24:36,080 --> 00:24:37,280
love eating meat the most.

505
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:40,480
With meat brought right to my mouth,

506
00:24:41,320 --> 00:24:42,520
there's no reason to turn it down.

507
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:44,760
Excellent.

508
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:46,520
The appearance of the Wind Rider Battalion

509
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,560
is meant to catch them off guard,

510
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:50,120
strike back,

511
00:24:50,320 --> 00:24:51,120
and deliver a fatal blow.

512
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:53,360
A fatal blow?

513
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:55,400
We're nowhere near that.

514
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:58,120
The Red Army only took out

515
00:24:58,880 --> 00:25:00,480
the Blue Army's long-range firepower,

516
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,640
crippled their armor and artillery,

517
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:05,120
and destroyed Blue Army special ops' gear.

518
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:08,760
But the Blue Army's proud Cheetah Commando

519
00:25:09,520 --> 00:25:11,240
remains completely unscathed.

520
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:13,600
Old Commander,

521
00:25:14,560 --> 00:25:16,600
even though you've been out of the army for years,

522
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:18,240
your military expertise

523
00:25:18,360 --> 00:25:19,560
hasn't diminished one bit.

524
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:23,000
You have a clear grasp of the battlefield.

525
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:23,920
You flatter me.

526
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:26,800
However, you don't know our battalion commander.

527
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:27,960
He

528
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:29,960
always manages to surprise us.

529
00:25:30,600 --> 00:25:31,600
Just you wait and see.

530
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:33,840
Indeed.

531
00:25:34,480 --> 00:25:36,480
It seems I really don't know him well enough.

532
00:25:55,840 --> 00:25:56,400
Captain.

533
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:57,760
Under infrared conditions,

534
00:25:57,960 --> 00:26:00,320
the precision kill rate has reached 60%.

535
00:26:00,520 --> 00:26:01,360
That's already very high.

536
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:03,200
As for any remaining equipment and personnel,

537
00:26:03,360 --> 00:26:04,760
Team Three will finish them off.

538
00:26:05,320 --> 00:26:06,840
Good. Prepare to relocate.

539
00:26:06,840 --> 00:26:07,240
Yes, sir.

540
00:26:41,320 --> 00:26:42,040
Comrades,

541
00:26:42,600 --> 00:26:44,520
based on the latest intel from command,

542
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:47,360
Eagle Beak Canyon isn't the only ambush.

543
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:49,680
We are adjusting the mission as follows.

544
00:26:50,320 --> 00:26:50,880
Ma Zhengzheng,

545
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:52,600
you'll handle close-quarters combat.

546
00:26:52,800 --> 00:26:53,400
Zhao Xiaoyun,

547
00:26:53,640 --> 00:26:54,840
you will lead Team One.

548
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:56,080
Once you reach the south slope,

549
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:57,520
use night vision gear

550
00:26:57,520 --> 00:26:59,280
and silent night-vision drones for support

551
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:01,280
to remotely command the special ops,

552
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:02,680
and eliminate nearby enemies.

553
00:27:03,120 --> 00:27:03,640
Snipers,

554
00:27:03,840 --> 00:27:05,120
secure the high ground on the left.

555
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:07,400
Focus on taking out any stragglers.

556
00:27:07,840 --> 00:27:08,640
Is that clear?

557
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:09,400
Clear!

558
00:27:09,760 --> 00:27:10,200
Move out!

559
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,400
Team One, follow me!

560
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,960
Team Two, follow me! Target: north slope.

561
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:00,680
Attention, Cheetah spotted.

562
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:01,760
Prepare to close the net.

563
00:28:01,760 --> 00:28:02,920
Targeted elimination.

564
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:09,880
Reporting. Unit One has reached the designated area.

565
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:10,360
Over.

566
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:15,760
Reporting.

567
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:17,200
Unit Two has reached the designated area.

568
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:18,160
Over.

569
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:42,400
Communications.

570
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:49,560
02, 02.

571
00:28:49,760 --> 00:28:50,480
This is 702.

572
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:51,880
Do you copy? Do you copy?

573
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:52,520
Copy.

574
00:28:52,520 --> 00:28:53,720
702, this is 02.

575
00:28:53,720 --> 00:28:54,480
Go ahead.

576
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:55,840
Enemy spotted. Halt advance.

577
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:56,960
Attention all units.

578
00:28:57,080 --> 00:28:58,320
Convoy, halt advance.

579
00:28:58,480 --> 00:28:59,720
Halt advance.

580
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:09,320
Reporting to Cheetah.

581
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:10,600
Red force vehicles have halted.

582
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:12,840
Recon vehicles advancing to check. Over.

583
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,040
Understood.

584
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:37,400
Team 1, Team 2, get ready.

585
00:29:42,080 --> 00:29:43,400
Once you find a spot,

586
00:29:43,400 --> 00:29:44,200
take cover immediately.

587
00:29:44,600 --> 00:29:45,640
He won't dare shoot.

588
00:29:49,520 --> 00:29:50,960
Team 1, Team 2,

589
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:52,400
respond if you copy.

590
00:29:56,240 --> 00:29:57,200
We've been ambushed.

591
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:58,640
What do we do now?

592
00:30:04,520 --> 00:30:05,600
The enemy on the hillside

593
00:30:05,600 --> 00:30:06,960
won't be able to get down anytime soon.

594
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:08,640
Wait for my command.

595
00:30:09,120 --> 00:30:11,000
Target this Red Army recon team now,

596
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:11,720
and launch an ambush,

597
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:13,160
and cover my ambush squad

598
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:14,680
as they charge into the enemy convoy

599
00:30:15,040 --> 00:30:16,480
to ambush their combat vehicles up close.

600
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:17,760
Yes, sir.

601
00:30:59,200 --> 00:30:59,960
Intercept vehicles

602
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:08,640
Equipment

603
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:51,800
Sorry, I hit a bit too hard.

604
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:54,280
You've lost. Withdraw from the exercise.

605
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:02,600
To tell you the truth,

606
00:33:02,920 --> 00:33:05,240
in my entire career from lieutenant to major,

607
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:07,400
I've never suffered such a huge loss before.

608
00:33:07,800 --> 00:33:08,920
Only you could pull this off,

609
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:11,320
or this command vehicle wouldn't be destroyed.

610
00:33:11,520 --> 00:33:13,480
My combat losses are negligible.

611
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:14,920
Anyway, once past Eagle Beak Canyon,

612
00:33:15,440 --> 00:33:17,200
the two combat teams will split up.

613
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:19,040
They each have their own commanders.

614
00:33:19,760 --> 00:33:21,520
My mission is already complete.

615
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:22,120
Dad.

616
00:33:22,120 --> 00:33:23,280
Did you see that?

617
00:33:23,280 --> 00:33:25,120
That's our Godspeed Morph

618
00:33:25,120 --> 00:33:26,040
exoskeleton equipment.

619
00:33:26,120 --> 00:33:27,560
It's not only extremely lightweight

620
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:28,400
and highly durable,

621
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:30,160
but it also provides great jumping power.

622
00:33:30,400 --> 00:33:32,120
It boosts a soldier's speed and payload

623
00:33:32,120 --> 00:33:33,480
by 20 percent.

624
00:33:34,600 --> 00:33:35,360
Yang Maolin

625
00:33:35,360 --> 00:33:37,200
is giving us a massive advertisement.

626
00:33:37,760 --> 00:33:38,840
If the exercise is a success,

627
00:33:38,840 --> 00:33:40,240
I'll give you major credit.

628
00:33:40,760 --> 00:33:41,800
You mean us.

629
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:04,760
This is the exoskeleton equipment

630
00:34:04,760 --> 00:34:06,760
designed by Military Dream Group, right?

631
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:10,320
Tonight has truly been an eye-opener.

632
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:12,040
As for the exoskeletons,

633
00:34:12,520 --> 00:34:13,760
this is just the beginning.

634
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:16,480
The best is yet to come.

635
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:19,360
When I saw Tian Kang earlier,

636
00:34:20,040 --> 00:34:22,320
in a chokehold by Red Army special forces...

637
00:34:23,120 --> 00:34:24,040
To be honest,

638
00:34:24,680 --> 00:34:25,840
it was hard to watch.

639
00:34:26,560 --> 00:34:27,120
Sir,

640
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:29,800
you need to remain impartial.

641
00:34:31,280 --> 00:34:32,600
It's not that I'm being unfair.

642
00:34:33,560 --> 00:34:34,360
You know,

643
00:34:35,160 --> 00:34:37,080
Tian Kang and his Cheetah Commando

644
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:39,120
were a model unit we established.

645
00:34:40,160 --> 00:34:42,000
But I never expected that overnight,

646
00:34:43,040 --> 00:34:45,440
Guo Zijian's troops would wipe them out.

647
00:34:46,600 --> 00:34:48,040
I'm just lamenting

648
00:34:48,640 --> 00:34:50,640
how the current speed of technological progress

649
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:54,000
can turn the honors we just earned

650
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:55,080
instantly

651
00:34:56,560 --> 00:34:57,840
into history.

652
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:05,000
Can I ask you guys a question?

653
00:35:06,240 --> 00:35:06,720
Go ahead.

654
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:08,320
Are you guys

655
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:11,280
the real Wind Rider Battalion?

656
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:15,880
Wind Rider Battalion.

657
00:35:16,240 --> 00:35:17,400
The real deal.

658
00:35:28,920 --> 00:35:30,560
All teams, move out.

659
00:35:43,280 --> 00:35:44,160
I didn't expect

660
00:35:45,160 --> 00:35:46,960
they'd beat us to it

661
00:35:47,680 --> 00:35:49,120
and ambush us at Eagle Beak Canyon.

662
00:35:54,160 --> 00:35:55,960
This kid is really something.

663
00:35:57,560 --> 00:35:59,160
He wiped out my entire Cheetah unit.

664
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:05,160
We were overconfident in the Cheetahs.

665
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:09,160
An opponent like Guo Zijian

666
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:12,880
always exceeds my expectations.

667
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:14,840
He thinks

668
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:17,360
using this tactic

669
00:36:18,040 --> 00:36:19,800
will win him this war.

670
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:22,880
He's being too naive.

671
00:36:37,040 --> 00:36:37,760
Yuanshan,

672
00:36:49,480 --> 00:36:51,000
I have a favor

673
00:36:52,040 --> 00:36:53,160
to ask of you.

674
00:36:54,320 --> 00:36:55,720
And you're the only one I can turn to.

675
00:36:57,520 --> 00:36:58,520
Brigade Commander Di.

676
00:36:59,200 --> 00:37:00,200
According to the mission,

677
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:02,400
I am now your staff officer.

678
00:37:03,040 --> 00:37:04,040
Just give the order.

679
00:37:26,600 --> 00:37:27,520
Well done.

680
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,040
Where is Guo Zijian now?

681
00:37:29,040 --> 00:37:30,160
Heading to the main battlefield.

682
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:31,040
Good, tell him

683
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:31,840
I'll say it again.

684
00:37:31,840 --> 00:37:32,880
Regarding Wind Rider Battalion's command,

685
00:37:32,880 --> 00:37:33,840
no interference, no overriding.

686
00:37:33,840 --> 00:37:34,240
Understood.

687
00:37:34,560 --> 00:37:35,680
Now, through Sky Eye

688
00:37:35,680 --> 00:37:37,160
and other intel channels, we've concluded

689
00:37:37,400 --> 00:37:39,520
that Sea Breeze Pass is the Blue Force's nerve center.

690
00:37:40,200 --> 00:37:41,560
We can launch the final assault now.

691
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:42,640
The Commissar is right.

692
00:37:43,320 --> 00:37:43,880
Chief of Staff,

693
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,400
hurry up and gather our men.

694
00:37:45,560 --> 00:37:46,720
Also, notify Jiang Shengqiang

695
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:48,200
to converge at Sea Breeze Pass immediately.

696
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:50,640
Make one thing clear to Guo Zijian.

697
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,320
He must commit at least two teams,

698
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:53,320
including the drone squadron,

699
00:37:53,720 --> 00:37:54,800
to support the main force's operation.

700
00:37:55,120 --> 00:37:55,920
But Sky Eye

701
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:57,560
after providing its last update,

702
00:37:57,800 --> 00:37:58,840
has been jammed.

703
00:38:00,600 --> 00:38:01,800
The information we have

704
00:38:02,320 --> 00:38:03,280
is already enough.

705
00:38:04,160 --> 00:38:04,720
Sir!

706
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:06,160
The First Team

707
00:38:06,160 --> 00:38:07,760
has reached the fertilizer plant in Dingge Zhen.

708
00:38:07,960 --> 00:38:08,520
But at the scene,

709
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:10,480
they found no Blue Force commandos.

710
00:38:11,040 --> 00:38:13,080
Then what did we bomb in those waves?

711
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:14,480
Was our intel wrong?

712
00:38:14,600 --> 00:38:15,800
The intel shouldn't be wrong.

713
00:38:16,600 --> 00:38:18,760
They found a lot of damaged equipment,

714
00:38:19,080 --> 00:38:20,560
but very few casualties.

715
00:38:21,120 --> 00:38:21,960
They asked where the others went,

716
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:22,680
but got no answers.

717
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:24,200
Where did they go? Where could they go?

718
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:25,200
They ran away.

719
00:38:27,320 --> 00:38:29,080
Wu Dazhou led his commando team

720
00:38:29,280 --> 00:38:30,600
just to seek revenge on us.

721
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:32,560
We can't find them now,

722
00:38:32,560 --> 00:38:34,000
so I'm afraid there will be trouble later.

723
00:38:34,600 --> 00:38:36,160
So, what's your assessment?

724
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:37,400
It's simple.

725
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:39,080
This isn't over yet.

726
00:38:39,720 --> 00:38:40,240
And,

727
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:42,440
relocate the command post.

728
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:43,240
Yes, sir.

729
00:39:09,360 --> 00:39:10,040
Order.

730
00:39:14,160 --> 00:39:16,600
Order all unit members near Sea Breeze Pass

731
00:39:18,280 --> 00:39:20,520
to quickly fall back near the command post.

732
00:39:22,240 --> 00:39:23,280
Stagger their positions

733
00:39:25,040 --> 00:39:26,000
and set up a tight defense.

734
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:26,960
Yes, sir.

735
00:39:46,200 --> 00:39:46,880
Brigade Commander,

736
00:39:47,560 --> 00:39:49,080
Currently, Liang Hong's information platform

737
00:39:49,080 --> 00:39:50,120
and our information platform

738
00:39:50,120 --> 00:39:52,200
have both captured the Blue Force command post's signal.

739
00:39:52,240 --> 00:39:54,640
We can confirm it's definitely Di Yunfeng.

740
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:56,560
Excellent.

741
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:58,040
They say this Di Yunfeng

742
00:39:58,040 --> 00:39:59,160
has never lost.

743
00:39:59,320 --> 00:40:01,200
This time, let's give him a good taste

744
00:40:01,200 --> 00:40:02,160
of defeat.

745
00:40:03,680 --> 00:40:05,480
If Guo Zijian hadn't planned ahead,

746
00:40:05,640 --> 00:40:07,600
and if Wind Rider Battalion wasn't a new-type battalion,

747
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,760
it's hard to say if we could've turned the tables.

748
00:40:10,680 --> 00:40:11,200
Report!

749
00:40:12,120 --> 00:40:13,800
Jiang Shengqiang and his men have arrived

750
00:40:14,240 --> 00:40:15,520
and are closing in with Dong Zhenguo.

751
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:16,560
At the same time,

752
00:40:16,720 --> 00:40:18,360
the personnel sent to Huangmei Ridge to clean up,

753
00:40:18,600 --> 00:40:19,880
Team Three of the Wind Rider Battalion,

754
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:21,400
with a 40 percent casualty rate,

755
00:40:21,840 --> 00:40:23,640
are also rushing to Sea Breeze Pass.

756
00:40:24,720 --> 00:40:26,280
This time, Di Yunfeng,

757
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:27,520
even if he grew wings,

758
00:40:27,760 --> 00:40:29,040
couldn't fly out of Sea Breeze Pass.

759
00:40:31,760 --> 00:40:32,320
Tell me,

760
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:35,160
what does everyone think

761
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:36,600
about the current situation?

762
00:40:38,160 --> 00:40:39,560
As for the operational procedures,

763
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,040
there are no issues.

764
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:43,600
But looking at this exercise,

765
00:40:44,200 --> 00:40:45,400
I still feel unsatisfied.

766
00:40:45,560 --> 00:40:46,880
It shouldn't end this quickly.

767
00:40:48,840 --> 00:40:50,560
If you ask me,

768
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:51,440
I'd sum it up like this:

769
00:40:52,400 --> 00:40:53,480
Each with their own hidden agenda.

770
00:40:54,000 --> 00:40:55,160
After running exercises for years,

771
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:56,640
everyone has gotten smart.

772
00:40:56,840 --> 00:40:58,920
So no one is willing to risk it all.

773
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:01,880
That is complete nonsense.

774
00:41:02,560 --> 00:41:03,200
Sir,

775
00:41:03,640 --> 00:41:04,640
we've all had our say.

776
00:41:05,040 --> 00:41:06,520
Whatever tricks you have up your sleeve,

777
00:41:06,640 --> 00:41:07,760
why don't you show us?

778
00:41:10,080 --> 00:41:10,960
My answer is...

779
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:13,440
The mantis stalks the cicada,

780
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:15,000
unaware of the oriole behind.

781
00:41:16,080 --> 00:41:17,520
Whoever can become

782
00:41:17,520 --> 00:41:20,120
the one with the slingshot behind the oriole

783
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:23,080
will likely be the one

784
00:41:24,240 --> 00:41:25,280
to have the last laugh.

785
00:41:27,080 --> 00:41:27,600
Sir.

786
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:29,400
When two armies face off,

787
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:30,760
there is only the mantis and the cicada.

788
00:41:31,400 --> 00:41:33,440
How could a third-party oriole appear,

789
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:35,320
let alone a fourth party with a slingshot?

790
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:38,480
The beauty of strategic thinking

791
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:40,320
lies exactly in this.

792
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:46,400
Lies exactly in this.

793
00:42:10,240 --> 00:42:12,360
The weather forecast wouldn't be wrong today, right?

794
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:14,880
Look at this beautiful sunshine.

795
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:30,800
Report. The cloud movement is correct.

796
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:31,600
The wind direction is correct.

797
00:42:31,600 --> 00:42:33,360
The wind should pick up around 1700 hours.

798
00:42:38,360 --> 00:42:39,920
I invited you to watch the sunrise.

799
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:41,600
And you're telling me all this nonsense.

800
00:42:43,240 --> 00:42:43,880
You...
